# Internal validation workspace. It is gitignored, so CI never has it — but a
# local `docker build .` would ship the whole directory into the build context.
# Nothing in it reaches the image, because every COPY here is explicit and
# narrow, but the build context is uploaded to the daemon and lands in BuildKit
# history and cache either way. It is not meant to leave the machine.
melhorias
